{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Obsidian Moon is\u00a0</i>a <strong>text-based detective adventure-simulator</strong> that puts you in the shoes of a 1930s homicide detective, Sam Carter, once-respected but now haunted by grief and failure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Carter, you\u2019ll be asked to solve a string of interconnected cases through logic, instinct, and the steady collapse of your own sanity.\u00a0Armed with vintage forensics, gritty intuition, and limited time, you\u2019ll follow leads, interrogate suspects, and make costly choices that may bring you closer to the truth, or break you entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Gameplay Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Sinister murder cases</strong> that interconnect into a larger plot involving a sinister cult that aims to resurrect an ancient dark entity. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player-driven investigation \u2013 </strong>interrogate witnesses, run forensic reports, dig into criminal records\u2026 or use your magnum to extract a confession (seriously don't do this)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/extras/e32e6f38f67b58f9b0f938106e778a63.poster.avif?t=1764863221\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/extras/e32e6f38f67b58f9b0f938106e778a63.webm?t=1764863221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/extras/e32e6f38f67b58f9b0f938106e778a63.mp4?t=1764863221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre-bending Investigation system\u00a0</strong>- A fusion of card-based mechanics like <i>Stacklands, and Cultist Simulator</i>, economy elements like <i>Papers, Please</i>\u00a0and classic Point &amp; Click adventure puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/extras/5da78fed1bf5811394b932995df0d728.poster.avif?t=1764863221\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/extras/5da78fed1bf5811394b932995df0d728.webm?t=1764863221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/extras/5da78fed1bf5811394b932995df0d728.mp4?t=1764863221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A noir descent into madness \u2013 </strong>choose between stability or spiraling; every lead costs you time, money\u2026 and maybe your mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple modes \u2013 </strong>including a Hardcore permadeath mode and immersive Noir black-and-white filter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three narrative lenses</strong> \u2013 track the crumbling psyche of Carter, the reactions of Chief O\u2019Hara, and the na\u00efve wonder of your partner, \u201cThe Kid.\u201d</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201c\u2026when the shadows devour the moon, SHE will rise again\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3462170?t=1764863221","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3462170?t=1764863221","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/854e23dd1520f928a0