 class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player-driven investigation \u2013 </strong>interrogate witnesses, run forensic reports, dig into criminal records\u2026 or use your magnum to extract a confession (seriously don't do this)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/extras/e32e6f38f67b58f9b0f938106e778a63.poster.avif?t=1764863221\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/extras/e32e6f38f67b58f9b0f938106e778a63.webm?t=1764863221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/extras/e32e6f38f67b58f9b0f938106e778a63.mp4?t=1764863221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre-bending Investigation system\u00a0</strong>- A fusion of card-based mechanics like <i>Stacklands, and Cultist Simulator</i>, economy elements like <i>Papers, Please</i>\u00a0and classic Point &amp; Click adventure puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/extras/5da78fed1bf5811394b932995df0d728.poster.avif?t=1764863221\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/extras/5da78fed1bf5811394b932995df0d728.webm?t=1764863221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/extras/5da78fed1bf5811394b932995df0d728.mp4?t=1764863221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A noir descent into madness \u2013 </strong>choose between stability or spiraling; every lead costs you time, money\u2026 and maybe your mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple modes \u2013 </strong>including a Hardcore permadeath mode and immersive Noir black-and-white filter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three narrative lenses</strong> \u2013 track the crumbling psyche of Carter, the reactions of Chief O\u2019Hara, and the na\u00efve wonder of your partner, \u201cThe Kid.\u201d</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201c\u2026when the shadows devour the moon, SHE will rise again\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Lost Cabinet Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/e95ff5b62b0e1ded6beb2654d6c86acd2354d124/header.jpg?t=1764863221","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Lost Cabinet Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3462170/1459731512/47d727b88bafe580bef78eeb17dfc56cec54aa55/1753120415/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753361910","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3462170/1459731512/47d727b88bafe580bef78eeb17dfc56cec54aa55/1753120415/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753361910","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3462170/1459731512/47d727b88bafe580bef78eeb17dfc56cec54aa55/1753120415/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753361910","id":257131301,"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131301/f436b66c99695ac665